                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After playing for 12 hours I feel like I can give this game a fair review. I seriously think this game is getting a bad rap. The map is different and sometimes hard to understand and the combat is a bit janky but the game is not unplayable. I honestly think this game has two mind sets:\r\n\r\nThose who played the other Arkham games and don't like this because its not the usual batman games\r\nThose who want more of the in-between story of Origins and Asylum and are willing to give it a shot. \r\n\r\nWhile I would not recommend this game at the full price it is now, I seriously suggest you wait for a sale and pick this up because its worth it if for nothing other than expanding the story arcs of characters.",
